# CQ5 and CQ6: What does a pizza baking involve - who, which role, where and when?
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
SELECT ?relation ?what WHERE {
  ?baking rdfs:label "pizza baking"@en .
  ?baking rdfs:subClassOf [ owl:onProperty ?p ; owl:someValuesFrom ?filler ] .
  ?p rdfs:label ?relation .
  ?filler rdfs:label ?what .
} ORDER BY ?relation
